            <title>Version 1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<p>First Sparkle-enabled build of Wavetype Pro.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Press Escape — or click the × on the listening popover — to cancel a dictation without transcribing.</li>
  <li>Fixed a stuck-recording issue when holding Fn together with other modifier keys (e.g. Fn+Ctrl+arrow for window snapping).</li>
  <li>First-launch prompt to move Wavetype Pro into /Applications when run from a DMG or Downloads folder.</li>
  <li>Auto-updates from now on — future versions install themselves with one click.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
